                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>A district court- martial may be convened by an officer having power to convene a general court-martial or by any officer empowered in this behalf by warrant of any such officer.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
