                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>The Indian Evidence Act, 1872 (1 of 1872) shall, subject to the provisions of this Act, apply to all proceedings before a court-martial.<br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
