                "dc.identifier.section_page_note" : [ {
                  "value" : "<span style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"></span>Any trial by a courtmartial under the provisions of this Act shall be deemed to be a judicial proceeding within the meaning of sections 193 and 228 of the Indian Penal Code (45 of 1860), and the court-martial shall be deemed to be a Court within the meaning of <sup>1</sup>[sections 345 and 346 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 (2 of 1974)]. <br/><hr style=\"border: none; margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 0;\"/>",
